{"sourceUrl":"https://chemistry.suda.edu.cn/df/8c/c16711a712588/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:50.676582+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://chemistry.suda.edu.cn/df/8c/c16711a712588/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span>根据</span><span>上级</span><span>文件</span><span>要求</span><span>，结合</span><span>学部</span><span>具体情况，特制定本</span><span>细则</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>一</span><span>、</span><span>接收</span><span>专业</span></p><p><span><span>材化部</span></span><span><span>全日制硕士研究生招生专业均可接收推免生</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>部分专业招收本科直博生，</span></span><span><span>具体专业</span></span><span><span>请登录</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>苏州大学研究生报考服务系统</span><span>”查阅</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>二</span><span>、</span><span>报名</span><span>程序</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>．</span><span>推免生登录</span><span>“</span><span>苏州大学</span><span><span>研究生报考服务系统</span><span>”（http://gsas.yjs.suda.edu.cn</span></span><span>）</span><span><span>，在</span><span>“招生栏目”中选择“全国优秀大学生推免预报名”进行注册、预报名</span></span><span>（</span><span>报名截止时间以系统为准</span><span>）。</span><strong><span><span>特别提醒：</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>该系统是</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>研究生院录取环节的</span><span>“苏州大学研究生报考服务系统”，</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>不是</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>教务处推荐环节的</span><span>“苏州大学本科生推免申请系统”</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>请</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>不要混淆！</span></span></strong></p><p><span>考生</span><span>须</span><span>提前</span><span>准备以下材料：</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）</span></span><span>我校</span><span>研究生报考服务系统</span><span>打印的推免申请表并本人签字。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）直博生需提供两位与申请学科有关的正高职称专家的推荐信（附件</span></span><span>一</span><span>），申请推免硕士生不用提交推荐信。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）</span><span>本科期间成绩单（由所在学校教务部门提供并加盖公章），大学英语等级证书，各类获奖证书及其他证明自己学习研究等水平和能力的材料；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>．</span><span>“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）</span><span>开通后</span><span><span>，所有推免生（包括前期已在我校</span><span>“苏州大学研究生报考服务系统”预报名的考生）务必登录教育部系统填写申请信息。</span></span></p><p><span>三</span><span>、</span><span>复试</span><span>与录取</span></p><p><span>1．</span><span>复试</span><span>考核</span><span>。</span><span>根据</span><span>材料</span><span>审核</span><span>择优</span><span>筛选</span><span>进入</span><span>复试</span><span>考核</span><span>名单</span><span>，</span><span>复试</span><span>采用</span><span>线上</span><span>线下</span><span>相结合</span><span>的</span><span>方式</span><span>进行，</span><span>按</span><span>学科专业成立面试专家组，</span><span>专家</span><span>根据评分要求独立评分</span><span>，</span><span>学部</span><span>加</span><span>强过程监管，确保公平公正。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>．</span><span>录取工作</span><span>。</span><span>综合考核</span><span><span>成绩以百分制计分，满分</span><span>100分，60分为合格。未参加复试、</span></span><span>综合</span><span>考核</span><span><span>成绩小于</span><span>60分</span></span><span>以及</span><span>思想政治素质和道德品质考核不合格的不予录取。</span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>．</span></span><span><span>教育部</span></span><span><span>“推免服务系统”开通后，获得推免资格</span></span><span><span>且复试</span></span><span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>通过的</span></span><span><span>考生进行网上报名并网上缴费（未缴费的考生视为放弃推免资格）</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>分别确认接收复试通知和待录取通知。考生在</span><span>“全国推免服务系统”可以接受多个复试通知，但只能接受一个待录取通知</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>确认录取后不得更改。</span></span></p><p><span>四</span><span>、</span><span>其他事项</span></p><p><span>1．</span><span><span>推荐免试生占原推荐学校的推荐指标，占我校</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span>年各基层研究生招生单位的硕博招生计划。被我校录取的推免生，如果在入学时未取得国家承认的本科毕业证书和学位证书，录取资格无效。</span></p><p><strong><span>2</span></strong><span><span>．</span></span><strong><span><span>所有推免生的资格审核确认、报考、录取均须通过教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”进行</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>未通过</span><span>“推免服务系统”录取的考生一律无效。</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>．</span></span><span><span>其他</span></span><span><span>未尽事宜及相关要求见苏州大学研究生院网页</span></span><span><span>－</span></span><span><span>招生工作</span></span><span><span>－</span></span><span><span>招生动态栏。</span></span></p><p><span>五</span><span>、考生咨询及申诉渠道</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>．</span><span>联系部门：</span><span>苏州大学</span><span>材料与化学化工学部</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>．</span><span>联系电话：</span><span>65</span><span>880</span><span>090</span></p><p><span>3．</span><span>电子邮箱：</span><span>chb</span><span>yj</span><span>s</span><span>@</span><span>sud</span><span>a.</span><span>edu</span><span>.cn</span></p><p><span>材料与化学化工学部</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"256aead61c76d87b2a912c3d3e8322d322f25abe0643ac10f67774dfa0d87997","textLength":1118,"sourceSha256":"7c30c8aa9b039c70346101c44df1ee9b425974d2534ce950c2e189bb9a0b35ea","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d1200820eed6aa8975a1","title":"2026年苏州大学材料与化学化工学部2027年接收推免生综合考核实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:50.676582+00:00"}
